### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

A job plan usually contains several steps, so this API returns the job instance information only and does not return a step instance ID. Query the job execution status with `job_instance_id` when step level information is needed.

| Field | Type | Never null | Description |
|-------|------|------------|-------------|
| job_instance_id | long | Yes | Job instance ID, used to query the execution status and logs afterwards |
| job_instance_name | string | No | Job instance name |
